# The relay image (packages/server/relay.Dockerfile) is the one image built
# from this repository: its context is the contract package and the relay's
# sources and its workspace lock consumer, so a build never uploads node_modules or a build.
*
!package-lock.json
!packages/contract/package.json
!packages/contract/tsconfig.json
!packages/contract/src/**
!packages/server/relay.package.json
!packages/server/relay-dependencies.mjs
!packages/server/src/relay/**
